            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Suppose two Israelites go to court to settle a dispute, and one is declared innocent and the other guilty. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If the guilty person is sentenced to be beaten, the judge is to make him lie face downwards and have him whipped. The number of lashes will depend on the crime he has committed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.11.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Cor 11.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He may be given as many as forty lashes, but no more; more than that would humiliate him publicly.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
